 "text": "Hey there, how are you? It' a traditional Japanese sauce made with soy sauce, rice vinegar, sugar, and a little sesame oil. Pretty much, yes. It' thick and sticky though, not runny like watercolor. It' one of the best starter sauces, it' balanced and not too strong. Try it on some chicken thighs tonight, you' thank me. The walls, window frames, and doors in the kitchen and the bathroom. It' your own little time capsule. You can paint your name on the back wall, people will actually stop and ask.",
